### Registro correcto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "angel@example.com",
  "displayName": "Angel",
  "password": "ClaveSegura123"
}

### Registro inválido (email mal y contraseña corta)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "esto-no-es-un-email",
  "displayName": "Angel",
  "password": "123"
}